description:
Forget everything you knew about reality. This video is your personal portal to EDC (Electric Daisy Carnival). Pure immersion, music, and an atmosphere that words cannot describe, but every cell of your body can feel.

No more words needed—just you, the bass, and the infinite Electric Sky.

Go full screen, put on your headphones, and let yourself dissolve into the world of PLUR (Peace, Love, Unity, Respect). In this video, you will experience:

The massive scale of the main stages and the raw energy of the crowd;

The magic of the midnight fireworks uniting thousands of hearts;

The unique "kandi" trading culture and stunning art installations;
